<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87406" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεργ-άζομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		 with pf.
		
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>work beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ βαρβάρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.158
				</span></i>
			; <i>work</i> or <i>till beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σπόρῳ νεόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					20.3
				</span></i>
			:—pf. also in pass. sense, <i>to be done
				before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προειργασμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.2.12
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.65
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ προειργασμένη δόξα</span>
			glory <i>won before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.1.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὀψώνιον . . τοῦ -ειργασμένου χρόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					266.8
				</span></i>
			 (Pergam., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
